OL,5,G1700 Dorset: Country and Coast
OL,6,     FWe visit the Isle of Purbeck;
OL,7,     FSherborne's oldest working bakery;
OL,8,     Fand 18-mile-long Chesil Beach with
OL,9,     Fits oyster farm. And at Sherborne
OL,10,     FAbbey, bell ringers practice for
OL,11,     Fthe Coronation. (Ep2)
